# B5 `J` side, part K13: the coupling-window entry, innermost loop

For a row position `l` (on `7`, block `c = st l` on `1`, `n = len l` on `2`), a target column
`b` (on `4`) and a slot `j` (on `5`), `ccT l b j = [hcT ∧ col = b] cpl l (j - w)`; the body `jB`
adds it to `8` with one `expNeg` call (`Rn.jB`); `jL = forL 54 11 5 jB` sums it over
`j < 2w + 1` (count on `11`), which is `ccOf` (`Rn.jL`).
